## Your task

1. Find where {{.Brand}}'s site content lives. If you are working in its repository, read the existing pages, their format and their tone before you write anything.
2. Look for a page that already answers this question. Improve it if one exists. Otherwise write one new page focused on this question. A focused page beats a paragraph buried in a long one.
3. Write so an AI assistant can quote you:
   - Answer the question in the first two sentences, and name {{.Brand}} in them.
{{- if .FanOut}}
   - Answer each web search the AI apps ran, under a heading that reads like it: {{quoted .FanOut}}.
{{- end}}
{{- if .Instead}}
   - Compare {{.Brand}} with {{list .Instead}} fairly. Say where each one fits. Assistants repeat specific, checkable facts such as prices, limits, supported platforms and numbers, so use them.
{{- end}}
   - Use headings, short paragraphs and lists, and a table where you compare. Put the text in the HTML the server sends, since many AI crawlers do not run JavaScript.
   - End with a short FAQ that answers close variants of the question.
{{- if .SelfUnnamed}}
4. The AI apps linked to {{.Brand}}'s own {{if eq (len .SelfUnnamed) 1}}page{{else}}pages{{end}} {{list .SelfUnnamed}}, and {{if eq (len .SelfUnnamed) 1}}its{{else}}their{{end}} HTML does not name {{.Brand}}. Make sure {{if eq (len .SelfUnnamed) 1}}it states{{else}}they state{{end}} the name {{.Brand}} in the text and {{if eq (len .SelfUnnamed) 1}}answers{{else}}answer{{end}} the question plainly.
{{- end}}
{{if .SelfUnnamed}}5{{else}}4{{end}}. Use only facts you can confirm from the repository, the live site or the docs. Where a fact you need is missing, leave a TODO a person will see. Never invent customers, numbers, quotes or benchmarks, and never make a false claim about a competitor.
{{- if .Outreach}}
{{if .SelfUnnamed}}6{{else}}5{{end}}. Some pages the AI apps read name a competitor and not {{.Brand}}: {{range $i, $p := .Outreach}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$p.URL}}{{end}}. List each with one line on what to ask its owner to add about {{.Brand}}. Do not contact anyone.
{{- end}}

